"Testar alarme de perigo (5 s)": "Test danger alarm (5 s)",
"Tocar alarme a partir de (CPM)": "Sound the alarm from (CPM)",
"Todos os alertas de radiação, com data e hora. Os marcados \"do contador\" foram achados depois, no histórico baixado do aparelho (aconteceram enquanto o app estava fechado ou desconectado).": "All radiation alerts, with date and time. The ones marked \"from the counter\" were found later, in the history downloaded from the device (they happened while the app was closed or disconnected).",
