"1. Fundo:": "1. Background:",
"tire a amostra de perto (uns 3 m) e deixe o RadiaCode no lugar de sempre.": "take the sample away (about 3 m) and leave the RadiaCode in its usual spot.",
"2. Amostra:": "2. Sample:",
